verification_strategy:
W2:
- Core tests: WorldSaverTests, AsyncSaveTests, StreamerSchedulingTests, FrameBudgetPlannerTests, CollisionHashTests, AllocationTests (byte budgets per mesh job and per generated chunk via GC.GetAllocatedBytesForCurrentThread), ResolutionGovernorTests, SpawnPreloadTests.
- perf.cmds asserts deterministic counters only:
  - saves.main_thread_ms_max == 0 path taken;
  - colliders.rebuilt_per_edit <= 2;
  - objects.rebuilds_per_remesh == 1;
  - grass.created_per_frame <= budget;
  - gc.gen2 == 0 over scripted travel;
  - assets.pending reaches 0.
- Before/after `perf spikes` p99 and max from a rendering run on medium, attached to the commit.
- Art lane: build_all.py --check, a montage contact sheet of assets/icons/items for manual review (outline, framing, side-on guns), and prop-texture array regeneration verified by manifest --check.

W4:
- ui.cmds block per widget:
  - hud.hearts, hud.golden_hearts, hud.stars;
  - buff icons, including the minion count;
  - boss bar value and icon;
  - chat lines;
  - merged pickup popup;
  - death screen cause;
  - smart cursor target.
- Inventory-open movement test: player.speed > 0.
- Shop: buyback and sell by click. Reforge: slot and cost.
- Menu tour after P2-30.
- Lavapipe ui.cmds tour at 1280x720 and 1920x1080 and at UI scales 1.0 and 1.5; the UiProbes layout.overlaps probe must be 0.
- F3 shows gd.hud and each gd.<widget> under 0.3 ms on medium.
- The P3-03 animation rebuild is followed by the animation tour.

W10:
- Core tests: TownArrivalRulesTests, Housing cache invalidation, Rescue, TownDefenseTests, TownHappinessTests, VisitorTests, Pylon network.
- town.cmds additions:
  - day-only move-in;
  - rescue of a bound Goblin;
  - housing query, assign and evict;
  - residents defend against a zombie;
  - Nurse heals.
- ui.cmds: the housing tab.
- Perf: the housing scan budget probe stays within its per-tick budget, and no room flood fill runs on the main thread above 1 ms.
- P5-22 golden hash re-pin.
- Portrait icon coverage.
